 equipment, and tilting jack and accessories. In addition, the company offers wheel press single and double cylinders; wheel skate trolleys; spring scragging and spring preload testing machines; RCC underpass bridge shifting; and customized components. It serves metal working ,plastics ,wood, rubber, electronics, and electricals industries. The company was formerly known as New BEMCO Engineering Products Ltd. and changed its name to Bemco Hydraulics Limited in December 1976. Bemco Hydraulics Limited was incorporated in 1957 and is headquartered in Belgaum, India."}}